<div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Paths of Enlightenment being treated as serious alternates to Humanity, with a replacement of the Tenets and Touchstones systems with something that would function for them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wishful thinking that we're ever getting Paths back with this &quot;nu-oWoD CofD-lite&quot; that is edition. From what I remember awhile back from interview on YouTube (correct me if I'm wrong), they already affirmed they're going to keep the mechanics of now and aren't going to change it. Which will be hilarious to see how they can reconcile the Touchstone system where you're inextricably linked to some shmuck character hard mechanic-wise; compared to the Paths, where as you say, are explicably linked to your PC's INTERNAL struggle with the Beast instead of the former aforementioned.<br /> <br /> They expect us to believe now all of a sudden a Gangrel on the Path of Feral Heart, for example, suddenly <i>MUST</i> now be intuned to some rando mortal just to stave the Beast? When the whole point of a Path like Feral Heart is about accepting the its predatory and instinctive urges? Wut? This isn't to get started on the other Paths just downright incompatible with this system.. its.. ugh.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":25523,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","user":"Shakanaka","date":". 03-16-2021, 06:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T16:01:34-07:00","id":1440288,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div