message\"><br /> <br /> This is HIGHLY Locationally dependent. There are Roughly 3 Million bears in the United States and they are not all that evenly distributed. Wolves are even worse off with less than 20k. And good luck getting a Gorrilla to Ghoul meanwhile people? People are common. There 330 million in the US for every bear you can get 110 people. This is before the fact that bears tend to be in highly rural enviroments while vampires tend to fight over serious urban centers.<br /> <br /> Now if you want to find animal that's generally common on the Kindred Front its called the Rat.. Katamari Damacy that into a ball of teeth and flesh that will give people nightmares...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Then ghoul people. Fleshcraft them if you must, also ghouled swarms of rats, and stray dogs have decent uses. Basically Vozhd are horrible cost/utility, but their are other options that work cheaper, easier, faster, and doable in bulk/","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-13T06:08:42-07:00","id":1443733,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1440062-v5-the-sabbat-thread?p=1443521#post1443521\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> This is really because of how rare tigers are in the wild. There may be more TZIM in the world of Darkness than Tigers. There probably are more vampires.</div> </div> </div> </div>5000 is a lot for the amount of vampires there are, and that's not counting all the cubs that go missing. <br /> <br /> <br /> Ultimately, humans with guns is going to be the most dangerous thing. Followed by humans with spears. <br /> For fun, you might want to fleshcraft an eagle into something super nasty/novel. <br /> <br /> My favourite way to kill someone with animalism is to simply strap a bomb to a pet and send him home. It's an elegant solution to most problems.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-13T07:17:25-07:00","id":1443737,"title":"","content":"The problem with fleshcraft is that flesh just isn't that great a building material. It's garbage not only compared to steel, but compared to bronze, or even wood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-13T07:22:40-07:00","id":1443739,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by 